webgpu-node runs on native-dawn (https://github.com/monteslu/native-dawn),
which builds Google's Dawn WebGPU implementation and its Node-API bindings.
Dawn and its dependencies keep their own licenses; native-dawn's binary
archives include them.

@kmamal/sdl is an optional, separately distributed peer dependency. Its
native window must outlive any attached WebGPU surface. destroy() and
detachWindow() release the surface without taking ownership of the window.
